# {{APP_CLI}} — Commands Reference

Full syntax for the {{APP_CLI}} CLI.

## Authentication

Tokens are stored in the OS Keychain via the `creds` CLI (no plaintext files).

```bash
{{APP_CLI}} auth set                # interactive masked prompt
echo -n 'sk-xxx' | {{APP_CLI}} auth set  # piped (CI-friendly)
{{APP_CLI}} auth show               # display masked token
{{APP_CLI}} auth show --raw         # display full token
{{APP_CLI}} auth test               # verify the token works
{{APP_CLI}} auth remove             # delete from keychain
```

## Resources

Every resource follows the same CRUD shape:

```bash
{{APP_CLI}} <resource> list                # GET /resource
{{APP_CLI}} <resource> get <id>            # GET /resource/:id
{{APP_CLI}} <resource> create [flags]      # POST /resource
{{APP_CLI}} <resource> update <id> [flags] # PATCH /resource/:id
{{APP_CLI}} <resource> delete <id>         # DELETE /resource/:id
```

Discover available resources and per-resource flags via `--help`:

```bash
{{APP_CLI}} --help
{{APP_CLI}} <resource> --help
{{APP_CLI}} <resource> <action> --help
```

## Global Flags

| Flag | Effect |
|------|--------|
| `--json` | JSON envelope `{ ok, data, meta }` (use this when calling programmatically) |
| `--format <text\|json\|csv\|yaml>` | Output format |
| `--verbose` | Debug logging |
| `--no-color` | Disable ANSI colors |
| `--no-header` | Omit table headers (for piping) |

## Output Envelope (`--json`)

```json
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": [ /* ... */ ],
  "meta": { "total": 42 }
}
```

On error: `{ "ok": false, "error": { "code": "...", "message": "..." } }` with non-zero exit code.

## Exit Codes

- `0` — success
- `1` — API or runtime error
- `2` — usage error / missing token / not found
- `3` — keychain locked or access denied

## Setup & Build

If the `{{APP_CLI}}` binary is missing or out of date (requires the local `api2cli` binary on PATH — it is not published on npm, so do not use `npx`):

```bash
bun --version || curl -fsSL https://bun.sh/install | bash
api2cli bundle {{APP_NAME}}
api2cli link {{APP_NAME}}
```

`api2cli link` adds `~/.local/bin` to PATH automatically.
